+
+  // A track of curvature rinv never reaches radius r if its helix diameter
+  // 2/|rinv| is smaller than r: L6 needs pT > 0.62 GeV, L5 0.49, L4 0.39, L3 0.30.
+  // Beyond that point every asin(0.5*r*rinv) in this package is NaN and the
+  // fixed-point projections are finite garbage. Check this before projecting to,
+  // or matching a stub in, any layer. The margin below 1 keeps the
+  // 1/sqrt(1-x^2) derivatives finite as well.
